This project's protocol understanding was reverse-engineered from the
author's own Phomemo D30 unit and cross-referenced against prior
open-source work on the same printer family:

- odensc/phomemo-d30-web-bluetooth (Apache-2.0) — Web Bluetooth
  implementation; used to confirm the ESC/POS raster byte layout over
  GATT byte-for-byte. This project inherits its Apache-2.0 license in
  acknowledgement.
- polskafan/phomemo_d30 (MIT) — classic-RFCOMM implementation;
  consulted for protocol cross-reference.
- crabdancing/phomemo-d30 (AGPL-3.0) — classic-RFCOMM implementation;
  its documentation was consulted as prior art (no code derived).

